            <ArticleTitle>Late thrombosis and drug-eluting stents.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>8, 10</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>On 14 September 2006, the United States Food and Drug Administration indicated that it had some concern over &quot;small but significant&quot; increases in the rates of death in patients treated with drug-eluting stents. This article considers the background and consequences of this matter.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
